# SafeScribe Frontend (Next.js)

## Stack

Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, Shadcn/UI, TanStack Query, React Hook Form + Zod, Zustand (auth/ui state only).

## Folder Structure

```
apps/web/src/
├── app/
│   ├── (auth)/           # login, forgot-password, reset-password
│   ├── (dashboard)/      # role-based layouts
│   │   ├── super-admin/
│   │   ├── admin/
│   │   └── pharmacist/
│   └── api/              # BFF routes if needed (token refresh)
├── components/ui/        # Shadcn primitives
├── components/shared/    # DataTable, PageHeader, ConfirmDialog, EmptyState
├── features/             # auth, users, audit — colocate hooks, schemas, components
├── lib/                  # api-client, auth, utils
└── styles/               # globals.css with CSS variables for theming
```

## UI Standards

- Install Shadcn components as needed; customize via CSS variables (`--primary`, `--radius`, etc.).
- **Dashboard layout**: Collapsible sidebar, top bar with user menu, role-aware nav items.
- **Data tables**: Use shared `DataTable` with server-side pagination; toolbar with search + filter dropdowns + bulk actions.
- **Forms**: React Hook Form + Zod resolver. Show field-level errors. Disable submit while loading.
- **Feedback**: Sonner toasts for success/error. Skeleton loaders on page load. Empty states with CTA.
- **Destructive actions**: Always use `AlertDialog` confirmation.

## Auth & Protected Routes

- Store tokens in httpOnly cookies (via API routes or backend Set-Cookie). Never localStorage for refresh tokens.
- Middleware (`middleware.ts`): check session, redirect unauthenticated users to `/login`, role mismatch to `/unauthorized`.
- TanStack Query for all server state; invalidate on mutations. Auto-refresh access token before expiry.
- `useAuth()` hook + Zustand for current user/role/permissions.

## API Client

```typescript
// lib/api-client.ts — typed fetch wrapper with auth refresh interceptor
const api = createApiClient({ baseUrl: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL });
```

## Accessibility

Semantic HTML, keyboard nav, focus rings, aria labels on icon buttons, sufficient color contrast.
